<h3 class="fadeInUp animatable">Paediatric Endocrinology</h3>
<p class="fadeInUp animatable">At our Paediatric Endocrinology Department, we provide comprehensive care for disorders of hormones, growth and metabolism in children—from infancy to adolescence. With a specialist team dedicated to early diagnosis, precise management and long-term follow-up, we ensure every child receives personalised endocrine care that supports healthy growth, development and overall well-being.</p>
<p class="pt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Our Specialised Services Include:</p>
<div class="workup-sec mt-3">
<h4 class="py-3 fadeInUp animatable">Diagnostic Work Up</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable first_class">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Hormonal Profiling</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Comprehensive blood and urine tests to assess hormone levels related to growth, thyroid function, puberty, adrenal activity, calcium balance and glucose regulation.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Dynamic Endocrine Testing</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Stimulation and suppression tests are used to diagnose conditions such as growth hormone deficiency, adrenal insufficiency, early or delayed puberty and disorders of glucose metabolism.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Bone Age Assessment</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>X-ray evaluation of skeletal maturity to assess growth potential, delayed or advanced bone development and endocrine-related growth disorders.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Ultrasound and Imaging Studies</h5>
</div>
<p>Ultrasound of thyroid, ovaries, testes and adrenal glands, along with MRI for pituitary evaluation in complex hormonal conditions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Interventional and Advanced Management</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Growth and Puberty Disorders</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Evaluation and treatment of short stature, tall stature, early puberty (precocious puberty) and delayed puberty, using evidence-based medical therapies and growth monitoring programmes.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Thyroid Disorders</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Management of congenital hypothyroidism, autoimmune thyroiditis, hyperthyroidism, thyroid nodules and related metabolic complications.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable speciality_banner_no"><img class="img-fluid speciality_banner" src="/upload/fileManager/specialise_banner/PaediatricEndocrinology.png"></li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Diabetes Management (Type 1 &amp; Type 2)</h5>
</div>
<p>Comprehensive care, including insulin therapy, education on glucometer use, continuous glucose monitoring (CGM), insulin pump therapy, dietary planning and psychological support for children and families.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Adrenal Disorders</h5>
</div>
<p>Diagnosis and treatment of adrenal insufficiency, congenital adrenal hyperplasia, Cushing’s syndrome and disorders involving abnormal cortisol or aldosterone levels.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Calcium and Bone Metabolism Disorders</h5>
</div>
<p>Care for conditions such as rickets, vitamin D deficiency, hypoparathyroidism, hypercalcaemia and metabolic bone diseases, with tailored medical and nutritional plans.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Obesity and Metabolic Syndrome</h5>
</div>
<p>Assessment and long-term management of childhood obesity, insulin resistance, dyslipidaemia and polycystic ovarian syndrome (PCOS), supported by multidisciplinary lifestyle and nutrition programmes.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Disorders of Sex Development (DSD)</h5>
</div>
<p>Collaborative care involving endocrinology, urology, genetics and psychology to diagnose and manage conditions related to atypical sexual development.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Medical Management and Specialised Clinics</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Growth Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Regular monitoring, growth charting, nutritional counselling and early identification of hormonal causes of growth delays or abnormalities.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Thyroid Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Comprehensive follow-up for children with hypothyroidism, hyperthyroidism, goitre, or autoimmune thyroid diseases.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Paediatric Diabetes Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Integrated care model offering insulin adjustment, dietary support, technology-assisted monitoring and education for families living with childhood diabetes.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>PCOS and Adolescent Endocrine Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Specialised evaluation and management of menstrual irregularities, acne, hirsutism, weight issues and hormonal imbalances in adolescent girls.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Adrenal and Pituitary Disorders Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Focused care for complex hormonal conditions requiring long-term monitoring, medication and imaging surveillance.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Obesity and Lifestyle Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>A supportive programme involving dietitians, physiotherapists, psychologists and paediatricians, aimed at improving metabolic health and preventing future complications.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animated">Long-Term Growth, Development and Family Support</h4>
<p class="fadeInUp animated">We provide structured follow-up programmes that monitor growth, puberty, metabolic health and treatment response. Our multidisciplinary team ensures holistic support through education, counselling, lifestyle planning and smooth transition to adult endocrine services when the time comes.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-5 fadeInUp animatable">
<h4>We have dedicated clinic for</h4>
</div>
